{"title":"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2.5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2.5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/490177efae52602597536715df220222f609c18e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10 + 20 + 30 + 40}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5476bbb77f955f622856f4e5d590d9ab07768da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 90 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 91 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 64 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f26f418481d3fc5d33391e9182c8693c98161d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10 + 20 + 30 + 40}{10} = \\frac{30 + 30 + 40}{10} = \\frac{60 + 40}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"359\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce77665ecb8edd3782ce595d29256f8b78eeacb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{100}{10} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that all of the numbers in the numerator are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, meaning we can factor out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from the start:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a849e49a7704b8497965d83f192cdcdb5b893e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10 + 20 + 30 + 40}{10} = \\frac{10(1 + 2 + 3 + 4)}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"309\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d74878abb0e25549131d68d916627987ce4e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 3 + 3 + 4 = 6 + 4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"373\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2.5\">Solution 2.5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2.5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83bdffc9ff1b0e73d7eb479f3bbff0d858191c40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + ... + n = \\frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"240\" height=\"40\" />, and do the same thing as solution 2 until we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc295706a1380c4af2ed52211cf866fa73d5e983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/2820d94df1da0e12847096b0fe68af901918e3e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = \\frac{4 \\times 5}{2} = \\frac{20}{2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"309\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) 